+// NOTE(openthesis): DST mode integration for deterministic network behavior.
+// TCP ISN generation and ephemeral port allocation are made deterministic
+// in DST mode by routing through the kernel's DeterministicRNG. This ensures
+// reproducible connection setup across simulation runs.
+//
+// TCP ISN: In tcp/connect.go, replace the random ISN with:
+//   if t.Kernel().DeterministicMode() {
